# Keep the Docker build context small and the image clean.
# Anything listed here is not sent to the daemon when building.

# Dependencies — installed fresh inside the image
**/node_modules

# Build artefacts — regenerated inside the image
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.turbo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Local Prisma client cache (re-generated by `pnpm db:generate` in the image)
**/.prisma
**/prisma/generated

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Git — not needed at runtime, makes context smaller
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude

# Local-only env files — secrets must come from compose, not the image
.env
.env.bak
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs and test output
**/*.log
coverage
.nyc_output

# Docker / compose itself — no point copying these into the image
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml
.dockerignore

# Docs / scratch
*.md
!SCOPE.md
